ent-WFPressedMachineParts = pressed machine parts
    .desc = A box of frames, brackets and housings pressed at an outpost. Traders buy them by the crate.
ent-WFOutpostPartsPressPack = parts press pack
    .desc = A packed parts press. Use it in hand facing your outpost's floor to set it up there.
ent-WFOutpostPartsPress = parts press
    .desc = Presses steel and plastic sheets into machine parts to sell, one box a minute while someone is home.
ent-WFOutpostPowerExporterPack = power exporter pack
    .desc = A packed power exporter. Use it in hand facing your outpost's floor to set it up there.
ent-WFOutpostPowerExporter = power exporter
    .desc = Sells 30 kW of your outpost's power to the grid for credit while someone is home. A builder cashes the credit out.
ent-WFOutpostMiningBotDockPack = mining bot dock pack
    .desc = A packed mining bot dock. Use it in hand facing your outpost's floor to set it up there.
ent-WFOutpostMiningBotDock = mining bot dock
    .desc = Houses two mining bots. By day they drill ore out of the rock round the outpost and fill the dock with it.
ent-WFMobMiningBot = mining bot
    .desc = A squat hauler with a drill. It goes out for ore by day and comes home at dusk.

